{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Note: Fire &amp; Light is currently in development. To follow the project\u2019s progress and join the community, find me on the Trigor Tech Discord and YouTube channel.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the Great Betrayal came the Great Deluge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire &amp; Light</strong> is a fast\u2011paced rogue\u2011survivor in an <strong>open world</strong> that persistently evolves with you. Several character classes are playable and can undergo <strong>class ascension</strong> mid\u2011run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/fcb3767e55a5b0259be832e378e9ad8a.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the Great Deluge, the world of Tyberion has been conquered by the <strong>Lords of Fire</strong>. You play a hero summoned by Adam to restore the Light and <strong>find Eve</strong>. Survive hordes of enemies and face the Fire Lords of each biome to advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/4e61634ab064fca15dc63d8192a0a5a5.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks trigger automatically toward your stick direction, letting you focus on impact, dodging, and exploration. At every level\u2011up, pick a new power card from over a hundred \u2014 <strong>replayability guaranteed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/0a0046f9115dcabab60a82a8f04bf308.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honor oaths to unlock new features and expand the universe. Tyberion grows along with you. <strong>Each oath is represented by a painting to unlock,</strong> and will change the course of your run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/03b0fc3747554ec7d45560237286b448.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between blazing runs, take a break in the Hub. Discover special events and the <strong>hidden relationships</strong> between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/f2098d87ead12a8099d131285e211de5.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every game over leaves a grave</strong> in Tyberion. You can return to it in the next run to honor it with a rose\u2026 or break your oath and <strong>loot the grave to obtain a power from the previous run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c6d3773c3e4955a9163bd44dcaab5a22.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in a world already corroded by the Great Betrayal, are you sure you also want to <strong>betray your oath?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884300?t=1768074168","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/fa587edfd5b700a831237558c7ce68d6f555b506/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768074168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/b95cbb6c6810a34cd910f536aa868b71effc786b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768074168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/b95cbb6c6810a34cd910f536aa868b71effc786b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768074168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains fantasy violence, dark themes, and suggestive character poses."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Note: Fire &amp; Light is currently in development. To follow the project\u2019s progress and join the community, find me on the Trigor Tech Discord and YouTube channel.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the Great Betrayal came the Great Deluge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire &amp; Light</strong> is a fast\u2011paced rogue\u2011survivor in an <strong>open world</strong> that persistently evolves with you. Several character classes are playable and can undergo <strong>class ascension</strong> mid\u2011run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/fcb3767e55a5b0259be832e378e9ad8a.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the Great Deluge, the world of Tyberion has been conquered by the <strong>Lords of Fire</strong>. You play a hero summoned by Adam to restore the Light and <strong>find Eve</strong>. Survive hordes of enemies and face the Fire Lords of each biome to advance the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/4e61634ab064fca15dc63d8192a0a5a5.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks trigger automatically toward your stick direction, letting you focus on impact, dodging, and exploration. At every level\u2011up, pick a new power card from over a hundred \u2014 <strong>replayability guaranteed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/0a0046f9115dcabab60a82a8f04bf308.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honor oaths to unlock new features and expand the universe. Tyberion grows along with you. <strong>Each oath is represented by a painting to unlock,</strong> and will change the course of your run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/03b0fc3747554ec7d45560237286b448.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between blazing runs, take a break in the Hub. Discover special events and the <strong>hidden relationships</strong> between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/f2098d87ead12a8099d131285e211de5.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every game over leaves a grave</strong> in Tyberion. You can return to it in the next run to honor it with a rose\u2026 or break your oath and <strong>loot the grave to obtain a power from the previous run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/extras/c6d3773c3e4955a9163bd44dcaab5a22.avif?t=1768074168\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in a world already corroded by the Great Betrayal, are you sure you also want to <strong>betray your oath?</strong></p>","developers":["Trigor"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884300/1acf46b2c3e962647fd8b41adf61ae3d827bb040/header.jpg?t=1768074168","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884300/1819198800/f7e9862566493bd024f42c8cb0eba69327ee6bdc/1760365756/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760801496","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884300/1819198800/f7e9862566493bd024f42c8cb0eba69327ee6bdc/1